Disclaimer / 免责声明

Dongens Semi Integrated N26 (DSI Platform) is an independent educational
PLC simulator. All UI, graphics, and code are created independently for
teaching purposes. It performs no communication with real PLC hardware and
cannot program physical devices.

Dongens Semi Integrated N26（DSI Platform）是独立开发的 PLC 教学仿真器。全部
界面、图形与代码均为教学目的独立制作。本项目不与真实 PLC 硬件通讯，不能向物理
设备下载程序。
